WEBVTT

00:01:59.699 --> 00:02:01.367
but I'm not allowed to click both.

00:02:01.409 --> 00:02:02.910
So which do I pick?

00:02:03.828 --> 00:02:06.789
Well, when I was younger,
I would always choose white.

00:02:06.789 --> 00:02:09.000
I simply concealed
a portion of my identity

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.710
to make my life easier.

00:02:11.002 --> 00:02:14.255
Instead of having to think
about what "other" meant on those surveys,

00:02:14.255 --> 00:02:16.883
I would compress my identity
into one single box.

00:02:17.466 --> 00:02:19.552
It was a quick and easy fix.

00:02:20.011 --> 00:02:21.179
But as I got older,

00:02:21.179 --> 00:02:24.640
I realized that "other" better reflected
my multiracial background.

00:02:25.516 --> 00:02:28.019
But that choice of "other"
comes at a cost.

00:02:28.644 --> 00:02:31.606
Even though I'm surrounded by loving
and understanding people,